{
  "contract": "subject-state",
  "version": 3,
  "about": [
    "Per-user subject state (envisioning/starlings#147 decision 5, slice 2; follow",
    "removed 2026-09-15): which subjects a person stars and mutes, and which",
    "group a subject is in. The Worker stores overrides only; a subject with",
    "no row is plain. Every client draws the rail from the same answer, so",
    "the rule is pinned here rather than re-derived per surface.",
    "TypeScript: packages/contracts/src/subject-state.ts. Swift:",
    "Sources/SubjectState.swift, reading this same file.",
    "work_list (2026-09-18): how the SUBJECTS list is ordered and cut, per",
    "person, one answer on every surface. Its resolution is pinned here too."
  ],
  "rules": [
    "GROUP: a subject is in exactly one group. partner -> partners. event ->",
    "events (docs/EVENTS.md). lead ->",
    "sales. project -> envisioning when Core's `internal` flag is true, or,",
    "only when the flag is absent, when the title starts with 'Envisioning ';",
    "otherwise clients. `internal: false` is external whatever the title says.",
    "RESOLVE: starred and muted have no default: absent is false. listed is",
    "what the rail shows and INBOX reads: not muted, and not of a kind the",
    "person hides. hidden_kinds, when present, decides (meet#975); absent",
    "(an older Worker), a lead is hidden while sales_enabled is off. Mute is",
    "about noise; the hide is about kinds.",
    "WORK_LIST: sort is activity | upcoming | busiest | alphabetical (default activity);",
    "group is none | relationship (default none); starred_only defaults false.",
    "A stored value resolves field by field: a field that is missing or",
    "unknown falls back alone, and the other fields keep what was stored.",
    "ORDER (work_list_order): one block in one sort. busiest = overdue desc,",
    "open desc, title. alphabetical = title. activity = the activity key",
    "descending, rows with none after in busiest order. The activity key is the",
    "later of last_activity_at and FLOAT. FLOAT (docs/EVENTS.md): a dated event",
    "from today out to 30 days floats to `now - daysUntil days`, so each day",
    "closer is a day higher and on the day it reads as touched now; past,",
    "undated or farther events do not float. Civil days in UTC. upcoming =",
    "dated events from today out, soonest first, then the rest as activity."
  ],
  "groups": [
    {
      "name": "partner is partners",
      "subject": {
        "kind": "organization",
        "title": "Acme Labs"
      },
      "expect": "partners"
    },
    {
      "name": "event is events",
      "subject": {
        "kind": "event",
        "title": "Web Summit"
      },
      "expect": "events"
    },
    {
      "name": "lead is sales",
      "subject": {
        "kind": "lead",
        "title": "Envisioning for Acme"
      },
      "expect": "sales"
    },
    {
      "name": "internal flag wins",
      "subject": {
        "kind": "project",
        "title": "Meet",
        "internal": true
      },
      "expect": "envisioning"
    },
    {
      "name": "external flag wins over prefix",
      "subject": {
        "kind": "project",
        "title": "Envisioning for Acme",
        "internal": false
      },
      "expect": "clients"
    },
    {
      "name": "prefix only when the flag is absent",
      "subject": {
        "kind": "project",
        "title": "Envisioning Meet"
      },
      "expect": "envisioning"
    },
    {
      "name": "plain project is clients",
      "subject": {
        "kind": "project",
        "title": "Acme rollout"
      },
      "expect": "clients"
    }
  ],
  "resolve": [
    {
      "name": "no override, client project",
      "sales_enabled": false,
      "subject": {
        "kind": "project",
        "title": "Acme rollout",
        "internal": false
      },
      "override": null,
      "expect": {
        "listed": true,
        "starred": false,
        "muted": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a muted client project leaves the rail",
      "sales_enabled": false,
      "subject": {
        "kind": "project",
        "title": "Acme rollout",
        "internal": false
      },
      "override": {
        "starred": false,
        "muted": true
      },
      "expect": {
        "listed": false,
        "starred": false,
        "muted": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a lead is hidden while Sales is off, star or not",
      "sales_enabled": false,
      "subject": {
        "kind": "lead",
        "title": "Acme"
      },
      "override": {
        "starred": true,
        "muted": false
      },
      "expect": {
        "listed": false,
        "starred": true,
        "muted": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a lead is listed with Sales on",
      "sales_enabled": true,
      "subject": {
        "kind": "lead",
        "title": "Acme"
      },
      "override": null,
      "expect": {
        "listed": true,
        "starred": false,
        "muted": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "starred and muted together",
      "sales_enabled": true,
      "subject": {
        "kind": "lead",
        "title": "Acme"
      },
      "override": {
        "starred": true,
        "muted": true
      },
      "expect": {
        "listed": false,
        "starred": true,
        "muted": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a partner is listed with no row",
      "sales_enabled": false,
      "subject": {
        "kind": "organization",
        "title": "Acme Labs"
      },
      "override": null,
      "expect": {
        "listed": true,
        "starred": false,
        "muted": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a hidden kind leaves the rail",
      "sales_enabled": true,
      "hidden_kinds": [
        "project"
      ],
      "subject": {
        "kind": "project",
        "title": "Acme rollout",
        "internal": false
      },
      "override": null,
      "expect": {
        "listed": false,
        "starred": false,
        "muted": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hidden_kinds decides over sales_enabled",
      "sales_enabled": false,
      "hidden_kinds": [],
      "subject": {
        "kind": "lead",
        "title": "Northwind pilot"
      },
      "override": null,
      "expect": {
        "listed": true,
        "starred": false,
        "muted": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a hidden kind keeps its star",
      "sales_enabled": true,
      "hidden_kinds": [
        "event"
      ],
      "subject": {
        "kind": "event",
        "title": "Summit"
      },
      "override": {
        "starred": true,
        "muted": false
      },
      "expect": {
        "listed": false,
        "starred": true,
        "muted": false
      }
    }
  ],
  "work_list": [
    {
      "name": "nothing stored is the default",
      "stored": null,
      "expect": {
        "sort": "activity",
        "group": "none",
        "starred_only": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a full row reads back",
      "stored": {
        "sort": "alphabetical",
        "group": "relationship",
        "starred_only": true
      },
      "expect": {
        "sort": "alphabetical",
        "group": "relationship",
        "starred_only": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an unknown sort falls back alone",
      "stored": {
        "sort": "newest",
        "group": "relationship",
        "starred_only": true
      },
      "expect": {
        "sort": "activity",
        "group": "relationship",
        "starred_only": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a missing field falls back alone",
      "stored": {
        "sort": "busiest"
      },
      "expect": {
        "sort": "busiest",
        "group": "none",
        "starred_only": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a wrong type falls back alone",
      "stored": {
        "sort": "busiest",
        "group": "none",
        "starred_only": "yes"
      },
      "expect": {
        "sort": "busiest",
        "group": "none",
        "starred_only": false
      }
    }
  ],
